+        root.setTitle("Tuning Shop");
+        root["BalloonTip"].reset_value();
+        var names = main::CareerParts::types; var parts = cachedParts(root, cp);
+        // The cached ratio the fitted column and every preview key read is verified on the installed configuration
+        // first: career entry no longer recomputes it for every record (CareerNativeTurbo, 2026-09-21). One prepare
+        // and one bisection per configuration per session, memoised there; drawWindow, cursorTo and buy read
+        // tuneFactors after this refresh of the same car.
