+    // A v13 journal: the v10 records with ten part types, and the championship blocks stored DENSELY.
+    // A v12 buffer is refused here like any other unknown layout - its series array held one block per event
+    // and its length no longer matches. The v12 reader is not kept resident beside this one, the same decision
+    // the project made for v9: an old journal gets the dialog and a fresh career, never a silent reinterpretation.
+    function restoreJournal(buffer, cap, version)
