+    // Target factors of slot i (or of an empty record when i < 0) with `type` taken as `stage` instead of the
+    // journal (type -1 = no override): [power percent to add, weight percent]. Compatible engine parts multiply;
+    // NA Tune and turbo replace each other. The weight part sets the mass percent (adaptation: floor 80 %). The power
+    // percent is a target for ratioFor; whatever ratio 100 cannot reach is the engine's limit.
